Converted sends request with basic authentication / request.headers[0]: the value is kept as the secret variable `sends_request_with_basic_authentication_authorization`, not in the file (sends request with basic authentication.yml)
Dropped collection / cookieJar: cookies are not imported
Converted collection: runs use the environment `Base Environment` by default, since it holds the imported credentials (opencollection.yml)
Converted imported credentials: the imported credentials are the secret variables `sends_request_with_basic_authentication_password`, `sends_request_with_basic_authentication_authorization`; their values are kept in the secret store, not in the file (environments/Base Environment.yml)
